        "main_text_has_explicit_synthesis": true,
        "si_used": false,
        "procedure": "Et3NOH (0.656 mL of a 1.37 M aqueous solution, 0.9 mmol) was added to [Ce(LOEt)(NO3)3] (258 mg, 0.3 mmol) in MeCN (20 mL) at −40 °C. The mixture was allowed to warm to room temperature (22 °C) and stirred for 1 h. Solvents were removed and the residue was extracted with Et2O (10 mL). Removal of Et2O afforded a yellow solid (106 mg, 50%). Recrystallization from saturated Et2O/MeCN/hexanes at −18 °C gave yellow single crystals suitable for X-ray diffraction.",
